title CLI Runtime Paths and Lineage Guardrails

participant Engineer
participant Entry as askslm.py
participant Runtime as cli._resolve_runtime_paths
participant Command as cmd_*
participant Loader as _load_and_enrich
participant Cache as results/_cache
participant Taxonomy as taxonomy.csv

Engineer->Entry: python askslm.py <command> --workspace <workspace> [optional paths]
Entry->Runtime: resolve inputs/config/output directories
Runtime->Command: use Workspaces/<workspace>/inputs,mapping_configs,results (or explicit overrides)

alt command == build-taxonomy-lineage
  Command->Taxonomy: load taxonomy.csv
  Command->Cache: compare taxonomy_lineage_db_stamp.json (sha256-based)
  Cache->Command: hit or miss
  Command->Cache: write taxonomy_lineage_db.json + stamp on miss
end

alt command == alpha-diversity
  Command->Cache: validate taxonomy_lineage_db.json exists
  alt lineage DB missing
    Command->Engineer: exit with remediation message to run build-taxonomy-lineage
  else lineage DB present
    Command->Loader: load/enrich metadata + taxonomy
    Command->Engineer: produce alpha CSV + HTML outputs
  end
end
